{"about_the_game":"In Spy Fever each player has 8 agents: 4 saboteurs and 4 infiltrators. <br>Which of your agents they are is however unknown to your opponent, as theirs are to you. <br>The objectives of the game are simple, the path to winning is filled with misdirection and incomplete information.<br><strong><br>Three ways to win</strong><br>- Infiltration: Plant an infiltrator behind the enemy lines.<br>- Sabotage: Plant your 4 saboteurs by getting them captured.<br>- Counter Intelligence: Capture all 4 enemy infiltrators.<br><br><strong>Online</strong><br>Start a game with your opponent by using a shared secret, regardless if they are on their computer, phone, or tablet.<br><br><strong>Hot seat</strong><br>Play eachother on the same computer by taking turns, no peaking!<br><br><strong>Spectate</strong><br>Players not taking part can watch as the game unfolds from the sideline, perfect for tournaments and friendly matches.<br><br><strong>Spy craft</strong><br>Gain information, create misdirection and change the conditions of the playing field using the Spy Craft cards.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2991690?t=1772628769","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991690/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772628769","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991690/3612103718dbe7a8b5ec663b1c22f31c20efb7d6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772628769","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991690/3612103718dbe7a8b5ec663b1c22f31c20efb7d6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772628769","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"In Spy Fever each player has 8 agents: 4 saboteurs and 4 infiltrators. <br>Which of your agents they are is however unknown to your opponent, as theirs are to you. <br>The objectives of the game are simple, the path to winning is filled with misdirection and incomplete information.<br><strong><br>Three ways to win</strong><br>- Infiltration: Plant an infiltrator behind the enemy lines.<br>- Sabotage: Plant your 4 saboteurs by getting them captured.<br>- Counter Intelligence: Capture all 4 enemy infiltrators.<br><br><strong>Online</strong><br>Start a game with your opponent by using a shared secret, regardless if they are on their computer, phone, or tablet.<br><br><strong>Hot seat</strong><br>Play eachother on the same computer by taking turns, no peaking!<br><br><strong>Spectate</strong><br>Players not taking part can watch as the game unfolds from the sideline, perfect for tournaments and friendly matches.<br><br><strong>Spy craft</strong><br>Gain information, create misdirection and change the conditions of the playing field using the Spy Craft cards.","developers":["Beardybird"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991690/header.jpg?t=1772628769","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> OSX 12<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core M<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 4600<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com